==Rules==
{{StageRule|12thAnni}}

==Battleground==
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*6 [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*2 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.
*2 [[One Horn]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[J.K. Bun Bun]] spawns after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*1 [[Dark Emperor Nyandam]] spawns as the boss after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Rush down the enemy base with cats like [[Courier Cat]], [[Can Can Cat]], and [[Fishman Cat]] to claim the 8500 [[Timed Stage Reward]].

==Trivia==
*Tsukai Domain is named after the Japanese words 津 ''tsu'' (port, harbor, or ferry) and 海 ''kai'' (sea).

